title: Placing Your People
subtitle: Paid secretaries choose the delegates. Whoever places them controls the party.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: rf_party
view-if: rf_apparatus_timer <= 0 and (player_leads = 1 or player == "stalin")
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rf_apparatus_timer = 3

= Placing Your People

The party has a growing staff of paid organisers. [? if player_leads : The Zentrale appoints them. ?][? if player_leads = 0 : You do not run the Zentrale, but your friends in the organisation department can steer appointments. ?]

- @place: Place loyal secretaries in the districts.
- @train: Send young cadres to Moscow for training.

@place
on-arrival: {!
Q.apparatus += 5;
Q.members -= 3;
Q[Q.player + '_strength'] += 4;
for (var f of window.RF.factions) {
    if (f != Q.player) { Q[f + '_dissent'] += 2; }
}
!}

Reliable people now run the district offices. Some old activists, passed over, leave in disgust.

@train
choose-if: funds >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The party cannot pay for the journey.
on-arrival: {!
Q.funds -= 1;
Q.apparatus += 3;
Q.autonomy -= 2;
Q[Q.player + '_moscow'] += 5;
Q[Q.player + '_strength'] += 2;
!}

A group of young functionaries leaves for the schools of the International. They will come back knowing Moscow's ways and whom they owe.
